1
00:00:45,882 --> 00:00:51,882
Cutting Grass is a drama film directed by Ruairí O'Brien.

2
00:01:31,764 --> 00:01:37,764
It’s a hot summer and a young inner-city boy, Donal, is trying
his hand at cutting lawns for pocket money.

3
00:02:17,647 --> 00:02:23,647
When he meets Gerry, his luck changes.

4
00:03:03,529 --> 00:03:09,529
Gerry, played by John Hannah.

5
00:03:49,411 --> 00:03:55,411
Donal, played by Karl Rice.

6
00:04:35,294 --> 00:04:41,294
John Sturgill Simpson (born June 8, 1978) is an American
country music singer-songwriter and actor.

7
00:05:21,176 --> 00:05:27,176
As of June 2024, he has released eight albums as a solo artist.

8
00:06:07,058 --> 00:06:13,058
Simpson's style has been met with critical favor and
frequent comparisons to outlaw country.

9
00:06:52,941 --> 00:06:58,941
His first two albums, High Top Mountain and Metamodern Sounds in Country Music, were independently
released in the US in 2013 and 2014 and in Europe, through the British record label Loose.

10
00:07:38,823 --> 00:07:44,823
The latter album was nominated for a Grammy Award for Best Americana Album, listed 18th on Rolling Stone's "50 Best Albums of 2014," and named among "NPR's 50 Favorite Albums of 2014." Simpson's third album, A Sailor's Guide
to Earth, was released in April 2016 on Atlantic Records and was his first major-label release, later earning him Best Country Album at the 59th Grammy Awards and also being nominated for Album of the Year.

11
00:08:24,705 --> 00:08:30,705
Simpson's fourth album, Sound & Fury, was released on September 27, 2019, and was
nominated for a Grammy Award for Best Rock Album at the 63rd Grammy Awards.

12
00:09:10,588 --> 00:09:16,588
He released two albums in 2020 – Cuttin' Grass, Vol.

13
00:09:56,470 --> 00:10:02,470
2 – which feature bluegrass interpretations of songs from across his
catalog, and marked his return to independent music.

14
00:10:42,352 --> 00:10:48,352
His seventh studio album, The Ballad of Dood and
Juanita was released in August 2021.

15
00:11:28,235 --> 00:11:34,235
Having promised to release only five studio albums under his own name, not counting the Cuttin' Grass
project, Simpson debuted the alter ego Johnny Blue Skies for his eighth album Passage du Desir.

16
00:12:14,117 --> 00:12:20,117
The tone is emotional.
